('Lamentations 3:25', 'The LORD is good unto them that wait for him, to the soul that seeketh him.', 'patience', 'KJV'),
('Proverbs 15:18', 'A wrathful man stirreth up strife: but he that is slow to anger appeaseth strife.', 'patience', 'KJV'),
('1 Corinthians 13:4', 'Charity suffereth long, and is kind; charity envieth not; charity vaunteth not itself, is not puffed up.', 'patience', 'KJV'),
('Psalm 27:14', 'Wait on the LORD: be of good courage, and he shall strengthen thine heart: wait, I say, on the LORD.', 'patience', 'KJV'),
